"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2cf647a9-bf9f-4a84-bdbe-cf2675cd1bf2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2cf647a9-bf9f-4a84-bdbe-cf2675cd1bf2\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a desk at <a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-53&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;157</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>~1~\n</p><p><br>\nA Harper's Testimonial: The Last Stand of Ketheric Thorm, Chosen of <a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\">Shar</a>.\n</p><p><br>\n[The pursuant text describes a battle between Ketheric Thorm's faithful and magical Harper forces.]\n</p><p><br>\nI do not know what magic the <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar\" title=\"Dark Justiciar\">Dark Justiciars</a> summoned to our plane. But if it came from the <a href=\"/wiki/Weave\" title=\"Weave\">Weave</a>, then let it be cursed for eternity. For three days, we sieged the <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Towers</a>. For three days, their darkbolts cleaved our ranks. And on the third day, as his men and woman at last began to fall, Ketheric entered battle.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715111007\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1611/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29608/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7876/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/